                         SUMMARY
------------------------------------------------------------

    g(1)   = 3 ↑↑↑↑ 3
    g(2)   = 3 ↑^(g(1)) 3
    g(3)   = 3 ↑^(g(2)) 3
    ...
    g(64)  = 3 ↑^(g(63)) 3

    Graham's Number = g(64)

